      "created_at": "2018-01-14T03:41:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Played a game with XPW Fanatic and Setback. Fanatic used her base power, so all damage would redirect to the villain.</p>\n<p>Next turn, Fanatic dealt some damage. Setback had two Friendly Fires in play, so there was a choice to deal him 2 melee damage, which was redirected to the villain.</p>\n<p>This has resulted in an infinite damage loop, where Friendly Fire triggers every time that 2 melee damage is directed to the villain.</p>\n<p>Is this intended? Unintended? Bug? Loophole?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:49.489Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
