      "raw": "Played a game with XPW Fanatic and Setback. Fanatic used her base power, so all damage would redirect to the villain. \r\n\r\nNext turn, Fanatic dealt some damage. Setback had two Friendly Fires in play, so there was a choice to deal him 2 melee damage, which was redirected to the villain.\r\n\r\nThis has resulted in an infinite damage loop, where Friendly Fire triggers every time that 2 melee damage is directed to the villain.\r\n\r\nIs this intended? Unintended? Bug? Loophole?",
