      "created_at": "2018-01-14T04:30:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It sounds similar to the Dual Crowbars / Friendly Fire interaction.</p><p>I tried reproducing this against Apostate with Tachyon / Setback / XPW Fanatic with only one Friendly Fire in play, but I did not reproduce what you're describing; Friendly Fire only triggered once per Fanatic damage instance, and did not re-trigger when damage bounced off of it to Apostate. I never saw a second copy of Friendly Fire, Apostate died too quickly. :p</p>",
